WEBVTT

00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:30.913
weird transitional, a zigzagging
period of law and grief.

00:00:34.746 --> 00:00:38.787
Oh, yeah, listeners, this is a really
weird time for a lot of us,

00:00:38.787 --> 00:00:43.287
for most of us when it comes to work,
our businesses and our lives.

00:00:43.704 --> 00:00:49.204
And I wish that I could get a clear vision
of where I ultimately want to go

00:00:49.621 --> 00:00:53.454
so that I can figure out how to
chart a path to get there.

00:00:54.121 --> 00:00:59.246
We have had to shelve so many of
our big plans and rethink what

00:00:59.246 --> 00:01:01.746
the heck comes next. Where to begin.